      The test call underneath re-invokes the current version of the function live, so you
      can see the actual runtime output flip from <code>—</code> to <code>$NaN</code> the
      instant the edit takes effect — in auto-apply mode that's the moment you click
      "Get AI suggestion"; in diff-review mode it's the moment you click Accept, and never if
      you click Reject.
    </p>
  </div>

